deft xml - commands (input -> output)
  convert   xml -> data       Change format: --to json|yaml|toml|jsonl
  diff      xml... -> report  Compare two files by structure
  format    xml -> xml        Tidy a file: --sort-keys
  merge     xml... -> xml     Deep-merge files; later files win
  validate  xml -> report     Check syntax, or a JSON Schema with --schema
More: deft xml <command> --help
